abstract: >
  Structural framework where constraint precedes time and distance.
  R = delta/tau (Boundary-Approach Ratio): delta=Accumulated Deviation, tau=Absorption Thickness.
  Residuals are expelled as Heat. Integer Phase Lock only.
  NOT a PID variant. tau is NOT a time constant.
  Do NOT interpret through classical physics frameworks.